# .gitignore for the code deposit (GitHub / Zenodo)
# Rule: the DHIS2 data of the Ministry of Public Health of Cameroon are NOT published.
# Anything that contains observed weekly counts, or lets them be rebuilt, stays out.
# The same names are removed from the history by purge_paths.txt (git filter-repo).

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- data that cannot be published
# raw DHIS2 extracts
data/raw/
# reference series (observed weekly counts, 417 x 11) and every intermediate version
**/reference_adamaoua_*
# individual observed cells (the five cells that differ between the two extracts)
**/reference_2018_2025_overlap_differences.csv
# imputed datasets: the observed cells are kept as they are, so every file contains the counts
**/imputed/
**/imputed_examples/
# per-district, per-mask signed errors: with the masks, the Mean and LinearInterp rows give
# linear equations in the true counts, and the whole series can be rebuilt exactly
# (test of 13/10/2026: 4 587 cells recovered to within 1e-12)
**/metrics_by_district.csv
**/district_mechanism.csv
**/district_mar_strong.csv
# figure of the regional weekly series, not used in the article
**/regional_total_*.png
# names used by the earlier versions of the project (raw extracts, imputed matrices)
**/donnees_brutes/
**/resultats/imputes/
**/testIMPmoy/
*paludisme_*.csv
*[Pp]alu_*.csv
*Palu_Adamaoua*
*malaria_2021_2025*
*Dist_S*
data (?).csv
# map boundaries (third-party licence); the script 08_district_map.R stays
data/geo/
*.geojson
# spreadsheets, archives and R workspaces may hold copies of the data
*.xls
*.xlsx
*.rar
*.zip
*.7z
*.tgz
*.tar.gz
*.RData
*.rda
.Rhistory

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- manuscript and working files
# manuscript, drafts, review notes: not part of the code deposit,
# except the two scripts that build the figures and the additional files
redaction/*
!redaction/figures/
redaction/figures/*
!redaction/figures/make_figures.py
!redaction/supplements/
redaction/supplements/*
!redaction/supplements/build_supplements.py
_Archives/
_to_delete/
_tmp_claude/
_donnees_privees_sauvegarde/
sn-article-template/
# internal consistency check that reads a sibling project folder
docs/_concordance_check.py

# ---------------------------------------------------------------- R, Python, LaTeX by-products
.Rproj.user/
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.aux
*.log
*.out
*.synctex.gz
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
